WEBVTT

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:13.270
Look! It's a bird! It's an airplane!

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:15.260
It's the Super-Man!

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:22.990
Super-Man Forest Roads

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:52.600
faster than a lightning bolt, more powerful than a thunderbolt, more powerful than a fast

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:52.940
hurricane.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:59.410
This incredible peasant of the planet Krypton, the Iron Man.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.140
Super-Man!

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.650
Equipped with a surprising physical form,

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:08.450
the Super-Man undertakes an incessant struggle for good and justice,

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.530
disguised as a reporter for a metropolitan newspaper.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:12.470
Clark Kent.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:36.370
I'm tired of this mission. I'll be happy when I finish my job here.

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:41.560
So, the Supreme Commander gave orders to wait for news of the American convoy.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:46.030
I think it's more sensible to find out your location. Guys, let's go!

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.420
Tenet, Tenet Kame.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:21.040
Miss Leyne?

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:21.180
Yes?

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.910
Take these important documents and destroy them.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:49.260
American stubbornness, I'll give you ten minutes to remember what you did with those documents or I would be obliged to illuminate your memory with fire.

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:50.120
So?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:51.680
What?

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.910
Take her to the bonfire.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:18.410
I think Mrs. Lane's plane has already reached the convoy at this time.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.070
We'll be there, Mr. Kent.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:22.860
Our arrival is scheduled for in two hours.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:23.660
Great!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.270
What did you say?

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.570
I said that...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:27.950
It's great!

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:46.920
I'm warning you, miss. Unless you speak, I will not free her from the hands of the natives.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.090
Stop talking and move, Captain!

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.290
Ready! Let's go!

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.240
What did they say? Where are the documents?

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:15.320
I can!

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:20.180
They are mine!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:23.120
Your sacrifice was in vain!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:29.050
Harry, get in touch with the Supreme Commander!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:29.460
Right!

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:57.770
It looks like there's a party there.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:04:59.720
No, no, it's not a party.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:00.730
What do you think of that?

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:05.220
What is it?

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.490
It's an airplane!

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:07.360
It's empty!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:08.240
My God!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.400
Lois, protect yourself.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:46.830
Answer, Destroyer X! Answer, Destroyer...

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.620
Ask the base about the submarine's situation.

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:49.980
You!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:06.040
Answer, Destroyer X! Answer, Destroyer X!

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:20.380
The torpedoes are ready, Commander.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:40.790
The military service has just reported that during this mission,

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:45.410
an entire fleet of enemy submarines was destroyed by American bombers.

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:48.320
According to them, the crossing of the ships is...
